# ============================================================
# PipelineSegment_Flow.graph
# Unity Visual Scripting  –  FlowGraph Node Specification
#
# ARCHITECTURE CONTRACT:
#   Collider setup in Initialize(), OnTriggerEnter natural-event
#   detection, and DieFromDamage() manager callback stay in C#.
#   VS reads CurrentHealth and calls TakeDamage/Die as atomic ops.
#
# NODE MAP:
#   [Update] → [GetComponent<PipelineSegment>]
#     → [GetMember: CurrentHealth]
#     → [Branch: CurrentHealth <= 0]
#       True → [Trigger Custom Event "OnPipelineSegmentDestroyed"]
#
# CUSTOM EVENTS:
#   "OnPipelineSegmentDestroyed" → play destruction VFX, notify HUD
#
# MACHINE SETUP:
#   ScriptMachine on each PipelineSegment prefab instance
# ============================================================